---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: clickbench_q23"
---
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: c DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |   Projection: hits.SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)) AS c, count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)                                                                                                                |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[hits.SearchPhrase]], aggr=[[min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)), count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)]]                                                                                               |
|               |       Filter: hits.SearchPhrase != LargeUtf8("") AND hits.Title LIKE LargeUtf8("%Google%") AND hits.URL NOT LIKE LargeUtf8("%.google.%")                                                                                          |
|               |         TableScan: hits projection=[Title, UserID, URL, SearchPhrase], partial_filters=[hits.SearchPhrase != LargeUtf8(""), hits.Title LIKE LargeUtf8("%Google%"), hits.URL NOT LIKE LargeUtf8("%.google.%")]                     |
| physical_plan | SortPreservingMergeExec: [c@3 DESC], fetch=10                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase, min(hits.URL)@1 as min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title)@2 as min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1))@3 as c, count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)@4 as count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)]             |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=10), expr=[count(Int64(1))@3 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                         |
|               |       AggregateExec: mode=FinalPartitioned, gby=[SearchPhrase@0 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)), count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)]                                                             |
|               |         RepartitionExec: partitioning=Hash([SearchPhrase@0], 16), input_partitions=16                                                                                                                                             |
|               |           AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[SearchPhrase@3 as SearchPhrase], aggr=[min(hits.URL), min(hits.Title), count(Int64(1)), count(DISTINCT hits.UserID)]                                                                  |
|               |             SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |               CayenneAccelerationExec: snapshots_scanned=<N>, files_scanned=<N>                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |                 BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   DataSourceExec: file_groups={16 groups: [<redacted>]}, projection=[Title, UserID, URL, SearchPhrase], file_type=vortex, predicate: SearchPhrase@39 !=  AND Title@2 LIKE %Google% AND URL@13 NOT LIKE %.google.% |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
+---------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
